.local/

# Maintainer records. A backlog of open work and a release dogfood checklist
# are notes to ourselves, not documentation for anyone installing this. They
# live in the private notes repository now; these lines stop them coming back.
docs/BACKLOG.md
docs/DOGFOOD.md

